 "sentences": [
  "Gillingham missed promotion by just one place.",
  "During the 1984–85 season, they played in the Third Division.",
  "They started strong with five wins in seven games.",
  "A brutal 7–1 defeat to York City later dropped them mid-table.",
  "They rallied by winning 12 of 16 games to climb back up.",
  "Overall, the team played 56 matches, winning 30 of them.",
  "Tony Cascarino finished as the club’s top goalscorer."
